  m_text: '<color=#999999><size=15>Time has run out.</size></color>


    You questioned
    some of your surroundings

    and felt the weight of doubt,

    but you remained
    mostly grounded.


    <color=#CCCCCC>A few illusions got under your skin,

    but
    you kept a grip on reality.</color>'
